OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start chilly with
OL,6,Fpatches of dense fog. The fog will
OL,7,Fgradually lift and thin through the
OL,8,Fmorning, leaving a generally dry day
OL,9,Fwith some decent sunny spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,11,FFeeling pleasant enough in the light
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,15,Fnight across the region. There will be
OL,16,Fclear spells, but given light winds
OL,17,Fareas of fog and patchy frost are
OL,18,Flikely to re-form.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
